    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know what im doing with my hands today. for 25 years every single second of my day was about her. now the house is just quiet and i feel like if i just sat here long enough, i'd eventually just disappear into the furniture. like there's nothing left of me to actually exist.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
