      "content": "I am so sorry you are feeling this heavy sense of emptiness and loss after 25 years; it takes a lifetime to be that close to someone and the silence you feel can feel like a dangerous end to your own life. Please know that your life still has a purpose now that you have this incredible knowledge of yourself to guide you; you don't have to \"disappear\" because you deserve to take the time to heal and let the weight of the past slowly lift from you. I suggest sharing this pain with a compassionate therapist who can help you move through this darkness and help you start to feel alive in a way that is safe and slow.",
