    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapist... i dont know. it feels like they'll just tell me to find a hobby or something. but there is no 'me' to find. like the person who cared for her is just gone. i look in the mirror and it feels like i'm looking at a stranger or a shell. it doesn't feel like a transition, it just feels like the end of the story. like the book is closed and there's nothing left to read.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
